  title: "TAL\u0130H TAPINA\u011EI'NDAN KA\xC7TIN"
  body: "G\xFCn \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 y\xFCz\xFCne vurdu\u011Funda arkanda mahzenin kap\u0131s\u0131 kendili\u011Finden kapan\u0131yor.\nLeyla'n\u0131n g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFC h\xE2l\xE2 cebinde. K\xE2tip'in masas\u0131 bo\u015F, Baron'un sesi art\u0131k duyulmuyor.\n\nTalih bu sefer seninleydi."
